+  // A site the user sent back to its desktop version: every top-level page of it, in that tab, is asked for with
+  // the desktop identity (header and navigator alike, through the tab's customUserAgent); any other site gets ""
+  // back, which means the mobile identity of the prefs. Decided before the page is requested, so nothing is
